          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "空手潜行并右键书台可收回钥匙。副本建造期间钥匙锁定，无法撤下。",
            "en_us": "Sneak and right-click the lectern with an empty hand to withdraw the key. It stays locked while the instance is building."
